*Lok's hatred of spiders from "''[[The Bookshop Hunter]]''" is referenced as he asks [[Otto]] if there will be any poisonous spiders in the desert, to which the latter humorously replies, "I thought we were looking for snakes!".
*This marks the first time (out of a total of five times) an episode's title is said by a character in that same episode.<ref>At Dante's house, in the beggining of the episode, Sophie reads from Eathon's journal: "When you observe the house of the sleeping kings, look north across the sands of Axum and behold '''the Golden Asp'''". At the end of the episode, Lok also says "Wow. '''The Golden Asp'''. That's it!" when he spots the structure.</ref>

